    "detailed_description": "Winona is the perfect girlfriend. She's so giving and kind, and the light of Reese's life - until one day, she winds up dead in Reese's kitchen. Reese is accused by a gargantuan tiger named The Judge of murdering Winona, and stumbles through a mindscape of her own making, exploring old memories and feelings about Winona in order to find the true culprit behind Winona's death.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nALTER EGO is a 2D point-and-click narrative-based adventure game featuring psychological elements. Reese the Rat discovers the dead body of her girlfriend, Winona the Sheep in her kitchen. Explore two levels with atmospheric environments, solve puzzles, and use the items in your inventory to uncover the mystery behind Reese and Winona\u2019s relationship, and find the real culprit\u2014if there is one.",
